<p>
  The document is a single <code>Y.Text</code> named <code>code</code>, bound
  to CodeMirror 6 by <code>y-codemirror.next</code>. Other people's cursors and
  selections come from awareness. Nothing on the server is specific to code.
  It stores and relays these updates the same way it does for every other
  demo. Try typing on the same line in both windows.
</p>
